{"id":"414e6c47808f5b0a","group":"91","path":"91/91-thm-fixed-point-lattice.md","title":"单调算子的固定点形成完备格","display":"thm-fixed-point-lattice — 单调算子的固定点形成完备格","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth","book_abbrev":"91","label":"91-thm-fixed-point-lattice","aliases":["91-thm-fixed-point-lattice","91-thm-fp-lattice","91-thm-fixed-point-structure"],"display":"thm-fixed-point-lattice — 单调算子的固定点形成完备格","depends_on":["[[91-thm-fixed-point-existence]]","[[91-df-minimal-fixed-point]]","[[91-df-maximal-fixed-point]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"91"},{"key":"label","html":"91-thm-fixed-point-lattice"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>91-thm-fixed-point-lattice</span><span>91-thm-fp-lattice</span><span>91-thm-fixed-point-structure</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-fixed-point-lattice — 单调算子的固定点形成完备格"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"0caf6a4fb6071bd3\" href=\"?note=0caf6a4fb6071bd3\" title=\"91-thm-fixed-point-existence\">91-thm-fixed-point-existence</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"460308c7099a8386\" href=\"?note=460308c7099a8386\" title=\"91-df-minimal-fixed-point\">91-df-minimal-fixed-point</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"2bc4d1a14a37aabf\" href=\"?note=2bc4d1a14a37aabf\" title=\"91-df-maximal-fixed-point\">91-df-maximal-fixed-point</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(L,\\sqsubseteq)\">\\((L,\\sqsubseteq)\\)</span> (完备格)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CLat}(L,\\sqsubseteq)\">\\(\\mathrm{CLat}(L,\\sqsubseteq)\\)</span> (<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(L,\\sqsubseteq)\">\\((L,\\sqsubseteq)\\)</span> 是完备格)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"J:L\\to L\">\\(J:L\\to L\\)</span> (单调自映射)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Mon}_{(L,\\sqsubseteq)}(J)\\coloneqq\n\\forall x,y\\in L\\,(x\\sqsubseteq y\\to J(x)\\sqsubseteq J(y))\">\\(\\mathrm{Mon}_{(L,\\sqsubseteq)}(J)\\coloneqq\n\\forall x,y\\in L\\,(x\\sqsubseteq y\\to J(x)\\sqsubseteq J(y))\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Fix}(J)\\coloneqq\\{x\\in L:J(x)=x\\}\">\\(\\operatorname{Fix}(J)\\coloneqq\\{x\\in L:J(x)=x\\}\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{lfp}(J),\\operatorname{gfp}(J)\">\\(\\operatorname{lfp}(J),\\operatorname{gfp}(J)\\)</span> (最小与最大固定点)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}fixed\\text{-}point\\text{-}lattice}\\vdash\n\\left[\n\\mathrm{CLat}(L,\\sqsubseteq)\\land\n\\mathrm{Mon}_{(L,\\sqsubseteq)}(J)\n\\right]\n\\to\n\\mathrm{CLat}\\bigl(\\operatorname{Fix}(J),\\sqsubseteq\\bigr),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}fixed\\text{-}point\\text{-}lattice}\\vdash\n\\left[\n\\mathrm{CLat}(L,\\sqsubseteq)\\land\n\\mathrm{Mon}_{(L,\\sqsubseteq)}(J)\n\\right]\n\\to\n\\mathrm{CLat}\\bigl(\\operatorname{Fix}(J),\\sqsubseteq\\bigr),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>并且</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{lfp}(J)\n=\n\\bigwedge\\{x\\in L:J(x)\\sqsubseteq x\\},\n\\qquad\n\\operatorname{gfp}(J)\n=\n\\bigvee\\{x\\in L:x\\sqsubseteq J(x)\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{lfp}(J)\n=\n\\bigwedge\\{x\\in L:J(x)\\sqsubseteq x\\},\n\\qquad\n\\operatorname{gfp}(J)\n=\n\\bigvee\\{x\\in L:x\\sqsubseteq J(x)\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>这是 Knaster–Tarski 定理的格形式。特别地，最小固定点是固定点偏序的\n最小元，最大固定点是其最大元；上面两式则分别由前固定点的下确界和\n后固定点的上确界构造它们。</p>\n<p>必须区分固定点格中的交并与环境格中的原始交并。任意固定点族的环境\n交或环境并未必本身是固定点；固定点格的下确界、上确界通常需再取适当\n闭包。只有极端情形因最小、最大固定点本身属于全体固定点，才可写成\n全体固定点的环境交与环境并。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"91-thm-fixed-point-existence","status":"resolved","id":"0caf6a4fb6071bd3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-thm-fixed-point-existence]]","embed":false},{"target":"91-df-minimal-fixed-point","status":"resolved","id":"460308c7099a8386","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-minimal-fixed-point]]","embed":false},{"target":"91-df-maximal-fixed-point","status":"resolved","id":"2bc4d1a14a37aabf","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-maximal-fixed-point]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"(L,\\sqsubseteq)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{CLat}(L,\\sqsubseteq)","display":false},{"tex":"(L,\\sqsubseteq)","display":false},{"tex":"J:L\\to L","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Mon}_{(L,\\sqsubseteq)}(J)\\coloneqq\n\\forall x,y\\in L\\,(x\\sqsubseteq y\\to J(x)\\sqsubseteq J(y))","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Fix}(J)\\coloneqq\\{x\\in L:J(x)=x\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{lfp}(J),\\operatorname{gfp}(J)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}fixed\\text{-}point\\text{-}lattice}\\vdash\n\\left[\n\\mathrm{CLat}(L,\\sqsubseteq)\\land\n\\mathrm{Mon}_{(L,\\sqsubseteq)}(J)\n\\right]\n\\to\n\\mathrm{CLat}\\bigl(\\operatorname{Fix}(J),\\sqsubseteq\\bigr),","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{lfp}(J)\n=\n\\bigwedge\\{x\\in L:J(x)\\sqsubseteq x\\},\n\\qquad\n\\operatorname{gfp}(J)\n=\n\\bigvee\\{x\\in L:x\\sqsubseteq J(x)\\}.","display":true}],"bytes":1812,"backlinks":[{"id":"e93fc3e2f8fd50d4","anchor":"ref-137","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[91-thm-CT-conservative.md]]\n[[91-thm-FS-consistency.md]]\n[[91-thm-FS-necessity-adequacy.md]]\n[[91-thm-FS-omega-consistency.md]]\n[[91-thm-FS-strength.md]]\n[[91-thm-KF-consistency.md]]\n[[91-thm-KF-minimal-fixed-point-characterization.md]]\n[[91-thm-KF-proves-PA-consistency.md]]\n[[91-thm-KF-soundness.md]]\n[[91-thm-McGee.md]]\n[[91-thm-T-schema-consistency.md]]\n[[91-thm-T-schema-partial-recovery.md]]\n[[91-thm-TB-completeness.md]]\n[[91-thm-Tarski-undefinability.md]]\n[[91-thm-VF-KF-equivalence.md]]\n[[91-thm-VF-conservative.md]]\n[[91-thm-compositional-completeness.md]]\n[[91-thm-conservative-extension-axioms.md]]\n[[91-thm-diagonal-lemma.md]]\n[[91-thm-fixed-point-existence.md]]\n[[91-thm-fixed-point-lattice.md]]\n[[91-thm-fixed-point-non-uniqueness.md]]\n[[91-thm-hierarchical-truth-consistency.md]]\n[[91-thm-iteration-convergence.md]]\n[[91-thm-kripke-jump-iteration.md]]\n[[91-thm-liar-not-provable.md]]\n[[91-thm-liar-sentence-properties.md]]\n[[91-thm-numeral-adequacy.md]]\n[[91-thm-positive-induction-adequacy.md]]\n[[91-thm-reflection-from-truth.md]]\n[[91-thm-revision-convergence.md]]\n[[91-thm-soundness-equivalence.md]]\n[[91-thm-stable-sentence-characterization.md]]\n[[91-thm-truth-induction-adequacy.md]]\n[[91-thm-truth-iteration-stability.md]]\n[[91-thm-truth-predicate-definability-hierarchy.md]]\n[[91-thm-truth-predicate-non-creativity.md]]\n[[91-thm-truth-predicate-stronger-than-provability.md]]\n[[91-thm-typed-conservative.md]]\n[[91-thm-untyped-nonconservative.md]]"}],"outgoing":["0caf6a4fb6071bd3","460308c7099a8386","2bc4d1a14a37aabf"]}